{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45419","headline":"降诞日内庭献寿应制 · 广宣","name":"降诞日内庭献寿应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庆寿千龄远，敷仁万国通。\n登霄欣有路，捧日媿无功。\n仙驾三山上，龙生二月中。\n修斋长乐殿，讲道大明宫。\n此地人难到，诸天事不同。\n法筵花散後，空界满香风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45419.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45419","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}